        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Scott Kelly\n- People: United States participant in Soyuz TMA-4 expedition\n- Projects: Soyuz TMA-4 expedition\n- Organizations: International Space Station (ISS)\n- Roles: ISS commander, school teacher\n\nFacts:\n- The Soyuz TMA-4 expedition included a United States participant.\n- The United States participant in the Soyuz TMA-4 expedition held a record of 381.6 days for the most time in space.\n- Scott Kelly was a school teacher.\n- Scott Kelly served as commander of the International Space Station on Expeditions 26, 45, and 46.\n- Scott Kelly broke the 381.6-day most-time-in-space record held by the United States participant in the Soyuz TMA-4 expedition.",
